"plan.tickrest.description" = "{appName}’s own routine. Defaults: a 20-second eye break after 20 minutes of work and a 5-minute movement break after 60 minutes of accumulated work. Short breaks do not reset the long-break timer.";
"plan.eye202020.description" = "A common eye-care recommendation: every 20 minutes, look at something about 20 feet (6 metres) away for at least 20 seconds. The exact timing has limited research support.";
"plan.fiftyTen.description" = "A common work-and-break pattern: work for 50 minutes, then take a 10-minute break. These durations are a practical starting point, not a medical standard.";
"plan.pomodoro.description" = "A time-management method. Defaults: focus for 25 minutes, then rest for 5 minutes. After the fourth focus session, take a 15-minute break instead.";
